# 6️⃣ Margin & Padding

One of the most important CSS concepts.

```css
.card {
    margin: 20px;

    padding: 30px;
}
```

### Margin

Space **outside** an element.

### Padding

Space **inside** an element.

```text
        MARGIN
    ┌───────────────┐
    │    BORDER     │
    │ ┌───────────┐ │
    │ │  PADDING  │ │
    │ │ ┌───────┐ │ │
    │ │ │CONTENT│ │ │
    │ │ └───────┘ │ │
    │ └───────────┘ │
    └───────────────┘
```

---

# 7️⃣ Box Model

Every HTML element can be understood as a box.

```css
.card {
    width: 300px;

    padding: 30px;

    border: 1px solid #ddd;

    margin: 20px;
}
```

Learn how these properties affect the final size of an element.

Also understand:

```css
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
```

This makes sizing easier to manage.

---

# 8️⃣ Container

Create a reusable container.

```css
.container {
    width: 90%;

    max-width: 1200px;

    margin: 0 auto;
}
```

This keeps your content centered and prevents it from becoming too wide.

---

# 9️⃣ Flexbox

Flexbox is used for arranging elements in one direction.

Example:

```css
.header .container {
    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    justify-content: space-between;
}
```

Important properties:

```css
display: flex;

flex-direction: row;

justify-content: center;

align-items: center;

gap: 20px;
```

---

# 🔟 CSS Grid

Grid is useful for creating layouts with rows and columns.

Example:

```css
.services-grid {
    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

    gap: 25px;
}
```

This creates:

```text
┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐
│ Service │ │ Service │ │ Service │
│    1    │ │    2    │ │    3    │
└─────────┘ └─────────┘ └─────────┘
```

---

# 1️⃣1️⃣ Hover Effects

Make elements respond when the user moves the mouse over them.

```css
.service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);

    box-shadow:
        0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}
```

Navigation:

```css
.navbar a:hover {
    color: #2563eb;
}
```

---

# 1️⃣2️⃣ Transitions

Make changes smoother.

```css
.navbar a {
    transition: 0.3s;
}
```

Without transition:

```text
Normal → Hover
```

With transition:

```text
Normal → → → Hover
```

---

# 1️⃣3️⃣ Buttons

Create reusable button styles.

```css
.btn {
    display: inline-block;

    padding: 13px 24px;

    border-radius: 8px;

    text-decoration: none;

    font-weight: 600;
}
```

Primary button:

```css
.btn-primary {
    background-color: #2563eb;

    color: white;
}
```

