# 1️⃣4️⃣ Responsive Design

A website should work on:

* 📱 Mobile
* 📱 Tablet
* 💻 Laptop
* 🖥️ Desktop

Use media queries.

```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {

    .hero-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .services-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

}
```

Desktop:

```text
┌────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐
│ Card 1 │ │ Card 2 │ │ Card 3 │
└────────┘ └────────┘ └────────┘
```

Mobile:

```text
┌──────────────┐
│    Card 1    │
└──────────────┘

┌──────────────┐
│    Card 2    │
└──────────────┘

┌──────────────┐
│    Card 3    │
└──────────────┘
```

